# Enterprise Value to Equity Value

### Standard Formula

```text
Equity Value
=
Enterprise Value
- Net Debt
```

or

```text
Equity Value
=
Enterprise Value
+ Net Cash
```

---

## Year 10 Example

```text
Enterprise Value
=
$24.0B
```

Net Debt

```text
=
- $10.1B
```

Therefore:

```text
Equity Value

=
24.0 + 10.1

=
$34.1B
```

