```

---

### Incremental Shares

Treasury Stock Formula:

```text
Incremental Shares

=
Options ×
(Share Price - Strike Price)
÷ Share Price
```

Calculation:

```text
168 ×
(34.1-12)
÷34.1

=
109M
```

