# Excel Formulas

### Net Debt

```excel
=Debt-Cash
```

### Equity Value

```excel
=EnterpriseValue-NetDebt
```

### Treasury Stock Method

```excel
=Options*(CurrentSharePrice-StrikePrice)/CurrentSharePrice
```

### Diluted Shares

```excel
=BasicShares+IncrementalShares
```

### Share Price

```excel
=EquityValue/DilutedShares
```

### Founder Ownership %

```excel
=FounderShares/DilutedShares
```

